<title>SRI LANKA: National Development in brisk turnover.</title>
<headline>National Development in brisk turnover.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in National Development Bank Ltd was heavy on Wednesday with 33,000 shares changing hands as the stock was seen as good long-term value and foreign investors took long positions, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors reckon the share offers are very good value at current levels for the long term,&quot; said a broker.</p>
<p>The stock was traded unchanged at 190 rupees. Further volume of 16,000 was bid at the same price.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsrom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
